      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers praise Dr. Diaz, Dr. Brecker, and the support staff for kind and grounded care. Pet parents appreciate that doctors take time to explain diagnostics thoroughly without rushing. One reviewer was frustrated with prescription refill policies under the subscription model, but still praised the responsive doctors."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate handling during pet exams"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients highlight gentle and thoughtful care for pets with special needs, including paralyzed dogs, rescue animals, and senior cats. Pet owners appreciate thoughtful welcoming touches like complimentary toys on first visits, which help animals feel comfortable in the clinic environment."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Fast app communication and updates"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents highlight seamless communication through the clinic's digital app. Clients commend quick responses to medical inquiries, intuitive questions from doctors, timely updates following dental surgery, and transparent access to pet health charts online."
      }
    }
  ],
